  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Cỡ mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bảng tần số ghép nhóm của mẫu số liệu như sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Khối lượng (gam)</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>82</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>84</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>86</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>88</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>88</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Khối lượng đại diện</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>81</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>83</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>85</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>87</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>89</mn></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số quả</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>18</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>24</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>13</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t\tSố trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm đã cho là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">‾</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>90</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>87</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>89</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>254</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>67</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tNhóm chứa mốt của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm trên là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>86</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mốt của mẫu số liệu là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>84</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>65</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>90</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là mẫu số liệu được xếp theo thứ tự không giảm.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>18</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>82</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>19</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>38</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>84</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>39</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>62</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>86</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>63</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>77</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>88</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>78</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>90</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>88</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Cỡ mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là số chẵn nên trung vị là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>45</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>46</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>45</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>46</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>86</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên trung vị của mẫu số liệu là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>90</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>24</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>84</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>58</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></semantics></math> lần lượt là là tứ phân vị thứ nhất và thứ ba của mẫu số liệu.<br>Theo đề bài ta có:<br>Măng cụt loại nhỏ có cân nặng nhỏ hơn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>.<br>Măng cụt loại vừa có cân nặng trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Măng cụt loại tỏ có cân nặng không nhỏ hơn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất của dãy số liệu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>90</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>84</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ ba của dãy số liệu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>90</mn></msub></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>68</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>88</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\tDo đó tứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>84</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>82</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu là\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>15</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>88</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>86</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>73</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy măng cụt loại nhỏ có cân nặng thuộc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>45</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Măng cụt loại vừa có cân nặng thuộc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>82</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>73</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Măng cụt loại to có cân nặng thuộc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>73</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
